//! End-to-end pipeline orchestration.
//!
//! Spins up the §7.1 pinned thread topology with rtrb SPSC rings between adjacent stages.
//! The detection chain is wired all the way through: relay → parser → state writer
//! (classifies + decodes router intent + predicts state delta) → sim worker (CSR
//! pool→route lookup, confidence chain, filter cascade, grid sizing) → REVM validator →
//! submitter. The submitter increments a counter today (executor is intentionally
//! deferred); the rest of the chain is real.

#![allow(clippy::too_many_arguments)]

