                                        // needs BOTH the new price/tick/liquidity AND a fresh window;
                                        // publish them as ONE batch after the window fetch, composed
                                        // from THIS snapshot `ns` (never a price batch now + a
                                        // re-snapshotted window batch later — which double-bumps and
                                        // rolls price/tick/liquidity BACKWARD if the first is still
                                        // queued). Carry `ns` + move so the post-fetch submit is the
                                        // SOLE write for this pool.
                                        needs_window.push((
                                            *pid,
                                            *slot,
                                            *addr,
                                            *tick,
                                            live_spacing,
                                            ns,
                                            moved,
                                            cur_gen,
                                        ));
                                        (None, 0.0)
